    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nForkin Earls Property are delighted to present No. 4 Bridgewater, Arklow to the market. Ideally positioned in the heart of Arklow Town, this beautifully presented three-bedroom, three-storey townhouse offers spacious, light-filled accommodation in an exceptionally convenient and sought-after setting. Extending to approximately 111 sq.m. (1,195 sq.ft.), this generously proportioned home is further enhanced by its location within a small, private, gated residential development, offering both security and peace of mind.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over three floors and comprises three generously sized double bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with a stylish en-suite shower room. The ground floor features a well-appointed kitchen, seamlessly flowing into a bright and inviting living area with direct access to a private, enclosed front patio garden, creating an ideal space for both relaxing and entertaining. The first floor accommodates two further double bedrooms together with a well-appointed family bathroom, while the upper floor is dedicated to the impressive principal bedroom suite.\n\nNo. 4 enjoys an enviable town-centre location, just moments from the Bridgewater Shopping Centre, cinema, cafés, restaurants, bars, schools and a wide range of everyday amenities. The property also benefits from attractive views towards the Avoca River, while the picturesque Arklow Boating Lake, scenic riverside walks and children's playground are all within a short stroll.\n\nFor those with an active lifestyle, Coral Leisure Arklow, complete with swimming pool and fitness facilities, is nearby, while Arklow Leisure Centre offers an excellent range of sporting and recreational amenities, including an outdoor running track. Arklow Marina and the town's scenic coastal walks are also just minutes away, further enhancing the appeal of this superbly located home.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, a secure gated setting and an unbeatable town-centre location, No. 4 Bridgewater represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, investors and those seeking a low-maintenance home within walking distance of every conceivable amenity.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.99m x 2.18m\nThe welcoming entrance hallway sets the tone for the home, offering a bright and inviting first impression. Finished with attractive laminate wooden flooring, the hallway provides access to the ground floor accommodation, while the staircase leads to the upper levels. Its generous proportions and natural light create a wonderful sense of space from the moment you enter.\n\nLiving Room - 4.61m x 5.59m\nA bright and spacious living room featuring laminate wooden flooring, a charming feature fireplace with a stone surround, and double doors opening to the kitchen. Large, glazed patio doors flood the room with natural light while providing direct access to the private front patio garden, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nKitchen - 2.01m x 3.31m\nThe well-appointed kitchen is fitted with an attractive range of solid wood wall and floor units, providing ample storage and generous worktop space. A large window fills the room with natural light, while the open connection to the living area through elegant double doors creates a bright and sociable space, ideal for modern day-to-day living.\n\nFirst Floor - Landing - 4.93m x 1.87m\nThe first-floor landing is bright and well presented, providing access to two generously proportioned bedrooms and the family bathroom. Continuing the home's bright and airy feel, the landing also features a staircase leading to the impressive second-floor principal bedroom, ensuring a practical and well-designed layout throughout.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.92m x 3.97m\nA bright and generously proportioned double bedroom featuring laminate wooden flooring and a large window that fills the room with an abundance of natural light, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.70m x 3.61m\nA bright and well-proportioned bedroom featuring laminate wooden flooring and a large window that fills the room with natural light. This comfortable space enjoys a bright and airy atmosphere, making it ideal as a guest bedroom, children's bedroom or home office.\n\nWC - 1.69m x 1.87m\nA well-appointed bathroom fitted with a three-piece suite comprising a WC, wash hand basin and enclosed shower cubicle. Fully tiled flooring and partially tiled walls provide a clean, low-maintenance finish, while the layout has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both space and functionality.\n\nSecond Floor - Bedroom 3 - 3.99m x 3.67m\nThe spacious principal bedroom occupies the top floor, creating a peaceful and private retreat within the home. Finished with laminate wooden flooring, the room enjoys an abundance of natural light from the large window, while the vaulted ceiling enhances the sense of space and character. This impressive bedroom is further complemented by the convenience of a private en-suite shower room.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.70m x 3.67m\nThe en-suite bathroom is fitted with a three-piece suite comprising a WC, wash hand basin and bath with overhead shower. Finished with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, the room is further enhanced by a Velux roof window, allowing natural light to flood the space and creating a bright and airy atmosphere.\n\nPatio Garden - \nThe property benefits from a private, enclosed patio garden, providing a low-maintenance outdoor space ideal for relaxing, al fresco dining or entertaining guests. Bordered by mature planting and established shrubs, the garden enjoys an excellent degree of privacy and is accessed directly from the living room, creating a seamless transition between indoor and outdoor living. Further enhancing its practicality, the garden also benefits from convenient side access.\n\nServices - \nMains electricity, water and sewageTelephone and fibre broadband available in the areaGas fired central heating\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom townhouse within a secure, gated development, extending to approx. 111 sq.m. (1,195 sq.ft.)</li><li> Private, enclosed patio garden with convenient side access</li><li> Well-appointed kitchen with ample storage and worktop space</li><li> Principal bedroom complete with a private en-suite</li><li> Prime centre location opposite the Avoca River, alongside the Marina, Bridgewater Shopping Centre including a cinema and plenty of outdoor amenities.</li><li> Walking distance to schools, cafés, restaurants, leisure facilities and coastal walks</li><li> Just 5 minutes from the M11 motorway, offering excellent commuter links to Dublin and Wexford.</ul>"
      },
